# Credential material. `keys-set/` holds the live Google/Firebase key set and
# `firebasepushnotification.json` is a Firebase Admin service-account private key —
# neither belongs in git. The API reads the service account from the
# `api_integrations_config` table first and only falls back to these files.
keys-set
keys-set/
keys
keys/
apps/api/src/shared/secrets/*.json

# Runtime uploaded media
apps/api/uploads/
